          "id": "timeline_239d3dc7dd25",
          "order": 285,
          "knownAtStart": false,
          "description": "“你们说过，只要找到承印之子，就能让天门永久闭合。”"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "beat_chapter_286",
      "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
